From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilia Alshanetsky <ilia@ilia.ws>
Date: Thu, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] Bound protocol decoding and ping retries

Treat every malformed native packet as a protocol error instead of a clean
end-of-stream. Do not publish or throw partially decoded server exceptions,
including during the handshake, and bound automatic ping recovery by the
configured retry count. The tests cover malformed packet classes, truncated
exceptions, and non-Pong/zero-retry recovery.
